{
  "format": "stasium.dungeon_monsters",
  "format_version": 1,
  "status": "proposed",
  "notes": [
    "Monster numbers are Proposed (WP8 says propose them, do not make them final). WP15 should score them.",
    "Base values are at the band's first level. Each level above level_min adds hp_per_level of the base HP and damage_per_level of the base damage, rounded.",
    "Hit chance for monster attacks uses the same locked hit bands as the heroes (Chebyshev distance).",
    "Base stats were lowered when room A grew to 6-8 monsters (solo for now): rat 10 HP / Gnaw 3, Sling Rat 8 HP / Sling 2 at range 2-5 with line of sight, Drudge 20 HP / Sickle 5, Ratking 70 HP / Crook 8.",
    "Line of sight (dungeon only; the Koliseo has no LoS rule): a ranged monster attack needs a straight line not crossed by a prop cell. Units do not block.",
    "When the boss falls, the monsters he summoned scatter (they leave the fight); his escort stays and must be beaten.",
    "The rat cap counts every live rat of the summoned kind, escort and summons together.",
    "Frostspire Archive (levels 10-20): Ice Construct (slow melee tank), Book Wraith (ranged Frost Bolt, range 2-5, line of sight, kites), The Pale Archivist (boss, Ledger Strike range 1-2; Unbound Pages calls 2 Book Wraiths on his 2nd turn and every 3rd after, one cap with the escort wraiths: 3 alive, 4 in all). The hero side is the level sheet (80 HP, 6 AP, 3 MP; points add a few %), so band stats sit near the cellar's.",
    "chill (attack): a hit takes `mp` MP off the hero's next turn (no stacking). signature2 kind hazard: cells around the hero; a hero who ends a turn on one takes `hp` and loses `mp_loss` MP next turn. stand_in: art to borrow (tinted) until a monster's own frames land. placeholder: drawn stand-in shape and height.",
    "Saltmaw Grotto (levels 20-30): Reef Crab (slow melee tank), Drowned Sailor (cutlass, two swings a turn), Drowned Harpooner (ranged Harpoon Throw, range 2-5, line of sight, kites), Old Saltmaw (boss, Angler Bite range 1; Lantern Lure, signature kind pull: from range 2-6 with a line he pulls the hero 2 cells toward him on his 1st turn and every 2nd after, then bites).",
    "signature kind pull: slides the hero up to `cells` toward the caster along the longer axis of the gap (diagonal when square), stopping at a prop, a body or next to the caster. signature2 hazard keys drag (cells the hazard drags a hero who ends a turn on it, toward the caster), lay_text and hit_text (coach lines). chill.word names the status (chilled by default)."
  ],
  "scaling": {
    "hp_per_level": 0.05,
    "damage_per_level": 0.03
  },
