  "stars": {
    "note": "Star difficulty mirrors the mobile Stasis stars (origin/mobile backend/stasis_catalog.gd). The player picks ★1-★5 per run on the entry panel; no unlock gate, as on mobile. Monster HP and damage are the level-band stats times the star row. Mobile's STAR_SCALE is tuned for a party of 4 from ★3 (PARTY_FOR_STAR, PARTY_SCALE); PC runs are solo for now, so only the solo row applies and the mobile multipliers are scaled down for a solo level 1-10 hero (see scale vs mobile_scale). Tuned with tests/sim_granary_stars.gd (solo bot, level 2, 8 runs x 5 classes): ★1 85%, ★2 68%, ★3 60%, ★4 58%, ★5 38%.",
    "mobile_scale": {
      "1": [
        1.0,
        1.0
      ],
      "2": [
        1.4,
        1.2
